out social matters - in the “ghetto” of Via Roma. In love with Pavel, Irene tries to help them, but her surge of solidarity goes perhaps too far, and she regrets it. Mehdi lives obsessed with an ancient guilt: his fragile soul is attracted to Evil. Predestination and moral choice. Two alternatives? Subjection to freedom of Good or Evil. What will the protagonists choose?","tagline":"There is no truth. There is only perception – Gustave Flaubert"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vpAtduJVqqFMi3crLSDcxn4o1Fn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qhX1i5RCiJjMgfqh2JhsfbGVduU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Movie","dateCreated":"2019-12-02T14:21:46Z","dateModified":"2025-10-13T08:55:45Z","description":"Pavel e Mehdi sono immigrati clandestini, che condividono un appartamento e si occupano di questioni sociali. Innamorata di Pavel, Irene cerca di aiutarli, ma il suo slancio di solidarietà forse si spinge troppo oltre, e se ne rammarica.","isFamilyFriendly":true,"name":"Three the Movie","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/652846-three-the-movie","countryOfOrigin":[{"@type":"Country","name":"Italia"}],"duration":"PT1H39M","genre":["Dramma","Mistero","Romance"],"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpAtduJVqqFMi3crLSDcxn4o1Fn.jpg","releasedEvent":[{"@type":"PublicationEvent","startDate":"2017-10-12"}],"datePublished":"2017-10-12","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Massimiliano Grazioli","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2473245-massimiliano-grazioli"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Alberto Torquati","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2473246-alberto-torquati"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Vivianne Treschow","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2473247-vivianne-treschow"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Werner Di Donato","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2473248-werner-di-donato"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Saverio Indrio","url":"https://www.th